            `&Saturating<T>` implements `MulRhs<Saturating<T>, Saturating<T>>`
            `&Wrapping<T>` implements `MulRhs<&Wrapping<T>, Wrapping<T>>`
            `&Wrapping<T>` implements `MulRhs<Wrapping<T>, Wrapping<T>>`
            `&f32` implements `MulRhs<&f32, f32>`
            `&f32` implements `MulRhs<f32, f32>`
          and $N others
